### System Architecture Pipeline

```text
[Public GitHub Repo URL]
         │
         ▼
 1. Ingestion & AST Extraction  ─── (shallow git clone, parse AST / imports)
         │
         ▼
 2. Architecture & Script Gen   ─── (BharatCode API: qwen-3.8-27b)
    ├── ARCHITECTURE.md
    └── storyboard.json (scenes, real code snippets, voiceover timings)
         │
         ▼
 3. Audio & Visual Synthesis
    ├── TTS Narration (Piper / Edge-TTS / Kokoro)
    └── Slides & Snippet Motion (Remotion CLI or FFmpeg + SVG animations)
         │
         ▼
[final_walkthrough.mp4 (60–90s) + ARCHITECTURE.md]

```

