### CLI Interface (`gitvideo`)

Provide a seamless single-command CLI:

```bash
# Running via npx / CLI
npx gitvideo https://github.com/expressjs/express

# Or Python CLI
gitvideo https://github.com/expressjs/express --output ./dist

```

**Output Artifacts:**

* `dist/walkthrough.mp4` (60–90 second 1080p narrated video)
* `dist/ARCHITECTURE.md` (Markdown gist of the repository)

